<title>POLAND: SLASKI MAY NET RISES TO PLN 19.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>SLASKI MAY NET RISES TO PLN 19.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 19.32 vs   18.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   30.14 vs   30.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 72.23 vs   62.33</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     125.12 vs  105.51</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 84.96 vs  147.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  142.71 vs  217.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		372.16 vs  360.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     608.14 vs  564.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
